---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="hero-pre">A manifesto for bioinformatics</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        <span class="hero-riir">RiiR</span><span class="hero-dot">.</span><span class="hero-bio">bio</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Rewrite it in Rust. Responsibly.</p>
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <p>
          AI coding assistants have made it possible to rewrite established
          scientific software in days rather than years. A wave of rewrites
          is coming to bioinformatics. These are the principles for doing it right.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-scroll">
        <span class="hero-scroll-line"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-content {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
  }

  .hero-pre {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 9rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero-riir {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-dot {
    color: var(--rust-500);
  }

  .hero-bio {
    color: var(--rust-400);
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-intro p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .hero-scroll {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-scroll-line {
    display: block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--rust-500), transparent);
    animation: scroll-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes scroll-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.6); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }
  }
</style>
